<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer starts search firms.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Oppenheimer starts search firms.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Scott Ehrens has started coverage of three Internet search companies, an Oppenheimer source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Ehrens rated Yahoo! Inc a buy. He rated both Excite Inc and Infoseek Corp outperform.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Yahoo! closed on Monday at 29-1/8, Excite at 15-1/16 and Infoseek at nine.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
